    <briefdescription>
<para>Ping-pong double-buffered FBO — one Shadertoy compute buffer slot. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns two <ref refid="classjuce_1_1OpenGLFrameBuffer" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::OpenGLFrameBuffer</ref> instances (read/write) and a <ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">shader::Pass</ref>. Each frame, <ref refid="structshader_1_1_buffer_1a77d994ece740392fb3582156dfc44871" kindref="member">render()</ref> binds the write FBO, runs the pass, then swaps read↔write so the next frame reads this frame&apos;s output.</para>
<para>Used for Shadertoy <ref refid="structshader_1_1_buffer" kindref="compound">Buffer</ref> A-D (feedback effects, particle sims, fluid).</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
